<title>SWITZERLAND: ABB names Lindahl president, CEO.</title>
<headline>ABB names Lindahl president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABB Asea Brown Boveri AG said its board named Goeran Lindahl president and chief executive officer to succeed Percy Barnevik.</p>
<p>It said Barnevik, 55, who has combined the roles of chairman of the board and president and chief executive, will remain chairman.</p>
</text>
